The remaining concern is that the endpoint deletes a user without handling the non-nullable FK relationships (`Order.user_id`, `ApiKey.user_id`), which is a data-integrity issue rather than an authorization flaw, and there is no explicit policy rule mandating audit logging for deletions. Neither constitutes a confirmed authorization (CWE-639/862/863) violation tied to a changed line.

